{"channelId":"UChco0jytyM0xliQHPfOe5vw","row":["Mayhew",2350,"Mayhew is an animal welfare charity working to improve the lives of dogs, cats and the people in our communities – at our Home in London and internationally.\n\nMayhew is more than an animal rescue centre. We are working to improve animal welfare in the community and to support the people who live in it. Our team work with people in crisis or in need of support and protect the vital bond they share with their animal.\n\nOur vision: a society where people understand the importance and value of animal welfare.\n\nOur mission: to promote animal welfare by delivering a broad range of community-based veterinary, care and education services in the UK and overseas.","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChco0jytyM0xliQHPfOe5vw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChco0jytyM0xliQHPfOe5vw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:00.925Z","channelId":"UChco0jytyM0xliQHPfOe5vw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"28cfe34f2dad0d978b23920b5da303f9d40c0a504087c66958150859e5cfb428","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"33aec7b59d18f33a49df7977a9457421778a9824f7f9d9d5ac6e3cd9cdf97588"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChco0jytyM0xliQHPfOe5vw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:00.925Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChco0jytyM0xliQHPfOe5vw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":2350,"raw":"2.35K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChco0jytyM0xliQHPfOe5vw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:20:00.925Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"keep","code":"biography_audience_admitted","reason":"完整主频